{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aThe Weaver\u300b is an action RPG inspired by the Eastern philosophy of the Five Elements (Wood, Fire, Earth, Metal, Water).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By entering your birthdate, you are granted one of these elemental powers and become an exorcist who fights off evil spirits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Smart Combat Using Five Elements and Their Interactions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, the powers of Wood, Fire, Earth, Metal, and Water exist.<br>Each element can either support or counter the others.<br>By learning how these elements interact, you can gain the upper hand in battle.<br>Gradually discover which element benefits you\u2014or puts you at a disadvantage\u2014and craft your own strategic playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852900/extras/a434942c2ae463e58131cd13a0e7ecb7.poster.avif?t=1755045327\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852900/extras/a434942c2ae463e58131cd13a0e7ecb7.webm?t=1755045327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852900/extras/a434942c2ae463e58131cd13a0e7ecb7.mp4?t=1755045327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tension-Filled Physical Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overwhelm your enemies with skill-based combo attacks, precise dodges, and sharp parries.<br>No matter how strong your opponent is, your agility will keep you one step ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852900/extras/cf96d8074b5ccfb28fd16f080fa99da3.poster.avif?t=1755045327\" width=800 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852900/extras/cf96d8074b5ccfb28fd16f080fa99da3.webm?t=1755045327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852900/extras/cf96d8074b5ccfb28fd16f080fa99da3.mp4?t=1755045327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3852900?t=1755045327","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3852900?t=1755045327","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852900/19990de9fb20175c292a8ad86c358fc4845fe725/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755045327","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852900/19990de9fb20175c292a8ad86c358fc4845fe725/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755045327","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aThe Weaver\u300b is an action RPG inspired by the Eastern philosophy of the Five Elements (Wood, Fire, Earth, Metal, Water).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By entering your birthdate, you are granted one of these elemental powers and become an exorcist who fights off evil spirits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Smart Combat Using Five Elements and Their Interactions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, the powers of Wood, Fire, Earth, Metal, and Water exist.<br>Each element can either support or counter the others.<br>By learning how these elements interact, you can gain the upper hand in battle.<br>Gradually discover which element benefits you\u2014or puts you at a disadvantage\u2014and craft your own strategic playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class